 qemu-server (9.2.13) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * migrate: wait for the 'failing' migration status introduced with QEMU 11.0
     to transition to 'failed', so that the error reported by QEMU gets logged.
     Previously, such a migration was aborted with an 'unable to parse
     migration status' error before QEMU finished its cleanup.
 
   * hotplug: name the missing PCI bridge in the error message when hotplugging
     a device fails because of it.
 
